      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:6:6:107:6",
      "text": [
        " أَنَّ رَسُولَ اللَّهِ ( صلى الله عليه وآله ) كَانَ يُعْجِبُهُ النَّظَرُ إِلَى الْأُتْرُجِّ الْأَخْضَرِ وَ التُّفَّاحِ الْأَحْمَرِ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Ali Bin Ibrahim, from his father, from Ali Bin Muhammad Al Qasany, from Abu Ayoub Al Madainy, from Suleyman Bin Ja’far Al Ja’fary, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Al-Hassan Al-Reza<sup>asws</sup> that Rasool-Allah<sup>saww</sup> liked looking at the green Citron and the red Apple’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "6. Ali ibn Ibrahim has narrated from his father from Ali ibn Muhammad al-Qasaniy from abu Ayyub al-Madiniy from Sulayman ibn Ja‘far al-Ja‘fariy who has said the following: “Abu al-Hassan, al-Rida’, has said that the Messenger of Allah, O Allah, grant compensation to Muhammad and his family worthy of their services to Your cause, liked to look at the green citron and red apple.’” "
        ]
      }
